'''Hunt for the Xenobeast''' (超拳獣ブンナグリオス大降臨, ''Chō Kenjū Bunnaguriosu Daikōrin'', '''Super Fist-Beast Bunnaglios Great Advent''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]] and appears on the '''7th''', '''8th''', '''21st''' and '''22nd''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Empress' Excavation 3]]. The first three stages yield nothing when completed, while the final stage drops the unit [[Bowler Cat (Rare Cat)|Bowler Cat]].

