==Appears==
===English Version===
*The 7th, 8th, 21st and 22nd days in any month
*First appearance: March 5th, 2025 to March 10th, 2025

===Japanese Version===
*The 7th, 8th, 21st and 22nd days in any month
*First appearance: January 11th, 2025 to January 15th, 2025

