==Trivia==
*The phrases "Monstrous Teacher" and "The hunt is on!" in Hunt for the Xenobeast's event poster may allude to the ''[[wikipedia:Monster Hunter|Monster Hunter]]'' franchise, as [[Xenobeast Bunaglios]] is a [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]], which are generally references to ''Monster Hunter''.

